  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity Building for Public Sector Internal Audit IDF</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of the grant would be to assist the Internal Audit Methodology Division (IAMD) within MoF to enhance the Internal Audit capacity to improve the knowledge and skills of internal auditors in the public sector.  Specifically the Grant will support the IAMD to (i) strengthen the institutional framework; (ii) enhance the capacity of the public sector internal audit in Kyrgyzstan, in particular improve the knowledge and skills of internal auditors in the public sector; and (iii) increase the awareness of the strategy implementation. This grant will have its vital contribution to ensure continuity of the challenging reforms in the critical Public Financial Management area and assist the government to implement its strategy on reforming the internal audit. TF012781</narrative>
  </description>
